# Build output
/target
/src-tauri/gen
/src-tauri/icons/*.png.tmp

# A personal OAuth registration: it belongs to whoever downloaded it, not to the repository. The app
# reads it from the app data directory; see `crates/mail-core/src/oauthclient.rs`.
client_secret_*.json
oauth-client.json

# Generated artifacts kept out of history
/src-tauri/target
*.log
# `tools/screenshot.mjs` writes this where it is run from. The *tool* is committed (it is how M1a-78's
# broken layout was found); the picture of the moment is not.
/screenshot.png
# Screenshots of a real mailbox. They were untracked but *not* ignored, i.e. one `git add -A` away
# from publishing someone's actual mail to the world.
/shot-*.png

# Audit output. The security and licence reports describe live weaknesses and quote the values that
# had to be removed from the tree, so they are working documents for the maintainer, not source.
/reports/

# Sahara / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
